    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just quiet... it's like the air is gone. i look at his side of the bed and i just feel this massive, crushing weight in my chest. it's like i'm just waiting for it to end. i'm so tired of fighting to stay here when everything that made life worth living is gone. honestly, it feels like there's nothing left for me.",
