      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It makes complete sense that you'd want to escape this pain—it's enormous, and your longing for him is proof of how deeply you loved. But what you're describing isn't peace; it's the exhaustion of grief tricking you into believing there's no other way. You're not \"stuck\" here—you're still here because there's still something unfinished, even if you can't see it yet. Please, don't make any decision about forever tonight; just stay for the next hour, and then the next, and let someone sit with you in that emptiness.",
